[SIZE=5][B]About This Build[/B][/SIZE]
This is a clean, daily-driver [B]Android 17 (CP3A.260905.010, API 37.1)[/B] Retail Google Pixel OS build tailored specifically for the [B]Realme X2 Pro (RMX1931 / RMX1931L1 / samurai)[/B] running on Snapdragon 855+ ([ICODE]sm8150[/ICODE]) with full [B]SELinux Enforcing[/B] security and [B]Built-in Wireless OTA System Updates[/B].

[SIZE=5][B]Key Features[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Built-in Wireless OTA Updates ([ICODE]Settings -> System -> System update[/ICODE])[/B]: Check, download (supports background/screen-off download + HTTP 206 Pause/Resume + SHA-256 verification), and one-tap auto-install updates via TWRP OpenRecoveryScript without wiping data.
[*][B]Genuine Android 17 Pixel Experience[/B]: Pre-bundled Google Play Services (GMS), Play Store, Retail Pixel Launcher, Pixel Wallpaper & Style, Material 3 Expressive SystemUI with hardware-accelerated Adreno 640 frosted blurs, and Roboto Flex variable typography.
[*][B]Linux 4.14 Kernel Adaptation Layer[/B]: Full Android 17 mainline eBPF networking/tethering backport + [ICODE]zygote_next[/ICODE] isolated native renderer compatibility for Chrome 156+ and WebView.
[*][B]Pixel 9 Google Camera 9.6 (BSG V53) Pre-Integrated[/B]: Patched Qualcomm Spectra 380 CHI HAL unlocking all 4 physical sensors under SELinux Enforcing ([ICODE]0.6x[/ICODE] 8MP Ultrawide, [ICODE]1.0x[/ICODE] 64MP Main HDR+ Enhanced/Night Sight, [ICODE]2.0x[/ICODE] 13MP Optical Telephoto, [ICODE]16MP[/ICODE] Front Selfie).
[*][B]Realme X2 Pro Hardware Hub ([ICODE]Settings -> System -> Realme X2 Pro Settings[/ICODE])[/B]:
[LIST]
[*][B]90Hz Samsung AMOLED[/B]: Smooth 90Hz / Adaptive 90Hz / 60Hz Saver, One-Pulse Anti-Flicker DC Dimming, Sunlight High Brightness Mode (HBM), sRGB / DCI-P3 / Vivid color profiles, and Snapdragon 855+ EAS [ICODE]/dev/stune[/ICODE] touch-boost.
[*][B]50W SuperVOOC Charging[/B]: Full 50W fast-charge support, Smart Charging Limit (80% / 90% / 100%), and live wattage/current/temperature telemetry.
[*][B]Dual Stereo Audio & LRA Haptics[/B]: Dual NXP TFA9894 stereo speaker EQ presets, 165 Hz water/dust speaker cleaner, and Awinic AW8697 X-axis haptic gain control.
[*][B]Off-Screen Gestures[/B]: Double-Tap to Wake (DT2W), Double-Tap Status Bar / Home Screen to Sleep (DT2S), Draw V for Torch, Draw O for Camera, and music swipe gestures.
[*][B]iOS 26 Concentric Icon-Cushion 90Hz Liquid Glass Dock, Hidden Pill & 1:1 iOS 26 Icon Suite (v1.5.1)[/B]: Elevated Liquid Glass Dock ([ICODE]62px / 23.6dp[/ICODE] bottom margin, uniform 4-sided [ICODE]~40px[/ICODE] icon cushion, smooth continuous curved corners [ICODE]R_dock = 96px, p = 2.65[/ICODE], [ICODE]0.58dp[/ICODE] 34-deg crystal rim, Page-0 refraction crop & toggleable [ICODE]Q Search[/ICODE] pill), globally hidden bottom gesture pill by default with live [ICODE]Show Bottom Navigation Bar[/ICODE] Settings toggle, 1:1 iOS 26 multi-plane & App Store icons across [ICODE]Auto / Default / Dark / Clear[/ICODE] modes, and one-tap iOS 26 Cyan/Cobalt wallpapers (zero global SurfaceFlinger blur overhead).
[/LIST]
[*][B]Official PixelOS 17.0 Smoothness & Hardware Codec2 Media[/B]: Native Adreno 640 SDM HWC2 OpenGL ES 3.2 composition, Hardware Codec2 1080p60/4K60 VP9/HEVC/AVC performance points, tuned 90Hz SM8150-AC PowerHAL ([ICODE]powerhint.json[/ICODE]), and native Private DNS (DoT/QUIC) compatibility.
[*][B]Pixel Backup & Optional Browser[/B]: Pixel XL Original Quality Google Photos backup enabled out of the box + one-tap verified Cromite Browser install.
[/LIST]

